msgstr "| `multi-node-Kimi-K2.5-W4A8-A2` | Kimi-K2.5 W4A8，2节点 |"

msgid ""
"| `accuracy-group-1` | Qwen3-VL-8B, Qwen3-8B, Qwen2-Audio-7B, etc. | nightly"
" |"
msgstr ""
