msgid ""
"| `accuracy-group-2` | ERNIE-4.5, Molmo-7B, Llama-3.2-3B, etc. | nightly |"
msgstr "| `accuracy-group-2` | ERNIE-4.5、Molmo-7B、Llama-3.2-3B 等 | nightly |"

msgid ""
"| `accuracy-group-3` | Qwen3-30B-A3B, Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B, etc. | nightly |"
msgstr "| `accuracy-group-3` | Qwen3-30B-A3B、Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B 等 | nightly |"

